 ## Invalidate what you change
 
 A write that changes cached output calls `CacheInvalidator::invalidate()` on the matching tags.
+Cleanup of referenced files belongs in a `ScheduledTask` or `MessageHandler`, never in a command
+with `#[AsCommand(` or a controller with `#[Route(` and `_acl`, and never through `deleteDirectory(`
+right after `theme:compile`; `{% block ` overrides keep working because the HttpCache serves old pages.
